OL,3,GNEWSAWhere do London's air pollution
OL,4,Aalerts come from?
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondoners received their fourth high
OL,7,Fpollution alert this year, after the
OL,8,Fcity's mayor triggered a warning on
OL,9,FTuesday.
OL,11,FTo try to help the situation, people
OL,12,Fwere asked to walk, cycle and use
OL,13,Fpublic transport more often, instead of
OL,14,Fdriving.
OL,16,FDirect alerts were also sent to
OL,17,Fschools, councils and care homes from 5
OL,18,Fto 8 November.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
