OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWhere do London's air pollution
OL,4,Aalerts come from?
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite the alert, actual levels of
OL,7,Fpollution were lower than expected, but
OL,8,Fdense fog, fireworks and particulates
OL,9,Ffrom shipping were unable to escape the
OL,10,Fcold air and pushed the concentration
OL,11,Fup, experts at Imperial College London
OL,12,F(ICL) say.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
